# Keep the working tree LF on every platform. The repo already stores LF, the
# Docker image is Linux, and Biome's formatter writes LF — without this, a
# Windows checkout gets CRLF and every `biome check --write` (including the
# pre-commit hook) rewrites files back to LF, producing endless churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git should never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
